WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:01:45.400
(Support Admin Watch on kissFlix.co)

00:02:22.199 --> 00:02:23.919
The place I've lived for 30 years

00:02:24.759 --> 00:02:26.479
turned out to be a den of desire.

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:28.280
The Cheng family

00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:30.599
has long been rotten to the core.

00:02:32.759 --> 00:02:34.159
The sickness of human nature

00:02:35.240 --> 00:02:36.479
is beyond cure.

00:02:46.039 --> 00:02:47.960
You're the only one I can't let go of now.

00:02:49.400 --> 00:02:50.319
Leaving you all alone

00:02:50.319 --> 00:02:51.560
in a place like this...

00:02:52.919 --> 00:02:53.840
I can't help but worry.

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:54.919
And I really don't want to.

00:02:59.639 --> 00:03:01.240
I'll take good care of myself.

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:04.319
The next Wine Competition is coming up.

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:06.120
We're just one step away.

00:03:07.840 --> 00:03:09.840
Once all these grudges are behind us,

00:03:10.919 --> 00:03:13.199
I'll go back to being Ye Xiaowei.

00:03:13.759 --> 00:03:15.280
And you can go back to being An Yi.

00:03:15.919 --> 00:03:18.199
We'll find a city we like

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:20.000
and start a new life.

00:03:20.240 --> 00:03:21.039
How does that sound?

00:03:22.240 --> 00:03:23.039
It's a promise.

00:03:36.960 --> 00:03:37.759
Hello.

00:03:49.159 --> 00:03:50.560
Why is she here?

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:53.360
Wasn't she fired?

00:03:53.439 --> 00:03:54.520
Why is she back?

00:03:54.520 --> 00:03:55.560
Judging by the situation,

00:03:55.680 --> 00:03:57.360
she probably has some new tricks.

00:04:04.479 --> 00:04:05.520
What are you doing at the company?

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:08.360
I'm holding Mom's shares by proxy.

00:04:08.400 --> 00:04:10.159
Report all company matters to me from now on.

00:04:10.319 --> 00:04:11.159
In ten minutes,

00:04:11.159 --> 00:04:12.479
come to my office to debrief.

00:04:12.759 --> 00:04:13.680
Director An,

00:04:20.560 --> 00:04:22.000
is this how you run the company?

00:04:22.680 --> 00:04:23.160
Director Lin,

00:04:23.160 --> 00:04:24.160
what is the meaning of this?

00:04:24.600 --> 00:04:26.120
Currently, our investment in emerging markets

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:27.240
is starting to show results.

00:04:27.639 --> 00:04:29.959
Product development has also entered a critical stage.

00:04:30.480 --> 00:04:31.399
Although there is resistance,

00:04:31.519 --> 00:04:32.480
the overall trend is positive.

00:04:32.480 --> 00:04:34.800
Pouring massive funds into emerging markets

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:37.199
yields no visible returns in the short term.

00:04:37.439 --> 00:04:39.160
And we're failing to maintain our old clients.

00:04:39.439 --> 00:04:40.600
Is this what you call

00:04:40.680 --> 00:04:41.879
good management?

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:44.160
Emerging markets are the key to future growth.

00:04:44.879 --> 00:04:46.560
Early investment is essential.

00:04:46.839 --> 00:04:47.600
The short-term pain

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:49.439
is to secure long-term benefits.

00:04:50.120 --> 00:04:50.879
As for the old clients,

00:04:50.879 --> 00:04:52.279
we are also following up with them.

00:04:52.519 --> 00:04:53.879
Don't give me this nonsense.

00:04:54.800 --> 00:04:56.240
I disagree.

00:04:56.519 --> 00:04:57.720
Does it matter if you disagree?

00:04:59.240 --> 00:05:01.560
This isn't your one-man show, Lin Wanmei.

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:04.319
I advise you

00:05:05.040 --> 00:05:06.759
to just do as I say.

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:09.759
Because I can't guarantee

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:14.040
that news of you not being part of the Cheng family

00:05:14.199 --> 00:05:16.199
won't become a trending topic tomorrow.

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:19.720
Lin Wanmei,

00:05:20.720 --> 00:05:21.839
you've got it all wrong.

00:05:22.759 --> 00:05:24.560
My current position in Gufeng Group

00:05:24.839 --> 00:05:27.120
doesn't rely on my status in the Cheng family.

00:05:33.399 --> 00:05:34.240
Just you wait.

00:05:35.319 --> 00:05:38.040
I will convene a Shareholders' Meeting to dismiss you.

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:42.160
I'll be waiting.

00:05:43.319 --> 00:05:44.800
That concludes today's meeting.

00:05:44.800 --> 00:05:45.519
Meeting adjourned.

00:05:45.839 --> 00:05:47.240
Right, right, okay.

00:06:04.199 --> 00:06:05.279
Hey, He Li.

00:06:05.279 --> 00:06:06.399
Get me in touch with

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:08.439
the one who previously refused to sell their shares...

00:06:08.439 --> 00:06:09.319
The mysterious shareholder.

00:06:10.079 --> 00:06:10.879
ASAP.

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:12.399
Alright.

00:06:12.399 --> 00:06:12.839
I got it.

00:06:40.199 --> 00:06:41.000
Surprised?

00:06:48.480 --> 00:06:49.920
Boss Yi, you really are

00:06:50.240 --> 00:06:51.560
full of surprises.

00:06:53.240 --> 00:06:54.399
You flatter me, Mr. Cheng.

00:06:56.399 --> 00:06:58.319
I believe you're well aware, Boss Yi,

00:06:58.959 --> 00:07:00.600
of why I asked you to meet today.

00:07:01.040 --> 00:07:01.839
Of course.

00:07:03.279 --> 00:07:04.639
All the shares I hold

00:07:04.800 --> 00:07:06.079
can be yours right now.

00:07:06.439 --> 00:07:07.240
Straightforward.

00:07:08.360 --> 00:07:09.319
Name your price.

00:07:11.319 --> 00:07:12.199
I don't want money.

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:14.720
I just want you to agree to one condition.

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:16.079
Go ahead.

00:07:16.639 --> 00:07:17.639
Leave Sang Luo.

00:07:18.480 --> 00:07:19.800
As long as you can do that,

00:07:20.519 --> 00:07:22.519
all my shares will be yours.

00:07:37.319 --> 00:07:38.720
You underestimate me, Boss Yi.

00:07:39.959 --> 00:07:41.399
Never mind these few shares,

00:07:41.879 --> 00:07:43.399
even the entire Gufeng Group

00:07:43.959 --> 00:07:46.000
doesn't deserve to be compared to Xiaowei.

00:07:46.519 --> 00:07:47.800
Then we have nothing to discuss.

00:08:07.319 --> 00:08:08.240
You've worked hard, babe.

00:08:08.319 --> 00:08:09.120
Have some water.

00:08:09.319 --> 00:08:10.160
Thanks.

00:08:15.079 --> 00:08:16.000
Do you still need this?

00:08:16.160 --> 00:08:17.160
If not, I'll throw it away for you.

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:19.199
I don't need this anymore.

00:08:19.680 --> 00:08:20.480
Just throw it away.

00:08:26.040 --> 00:08:28.079
Sang Luo and Cheng An are not blood-related.

00:08:28.839 --> 00:08:29.519
Sang Luo...

00:08:29.639 --> 00:08:30.480
isn't from the Cheng family.

00:08:32.279 --> 00:08:33.080
What do you mean?

00:08:33.159 --> 00:08:34.759
I said Sang Luo isn't from the Cheng family.

00:08:39.600 --> 00:08:40.399
Exactly.

00:08:40.679 --> 00:08:42.960
Sang Luo and Cheng An are not blood-related.

00:08:43.519 --> 00:08:44.559
Does it have to mean

00:08:44.559 --> 00:08:46.159
that Cheng An isn't from the Cheng family?

00:08:46.559 --> 00:08:48.159
Sang Luo could be the one not from the Cheng family!

00:08:48.759 --> 00:08:49.559
You're right.

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:55.159
You really are my lucky star.

00:08:57.159 --> 00:08:58.240
My dear lucky star,

00:08:58.360 --> 00:08:59.120
would you be willing

00:08:59.120 --> 00:09:00.480
to go to South Korea for me?

00:09:00.480 --> 00:09:02.440
To investigate Sang Luo's background?

00:09:19.440 --> 00:09:20.120
What do you mean?

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:20.879
Lin Wanmei.

00:09:21.279 --> 00:09:23.080
Is settling a personal score fun for you?

00:09:24.440 --> 00:09:26.960
Rejecting your new wine R&D plan

00:09:27.480 --> 00:09:28.879
is settling a personal score?

00:09:29.799 --> 00:09:30.799
Well, I'd say

00:09:31.559 --> 00:09:33.240
you're just not capable enough.

00:09:34.519 --> 00:09:35.600
Choosing such a niche

00:09:35.600 --> 00:09:37.399
and expensive grape variety,

00:09:37.519 --> 00:09:39.519
plus bringing in new brewing methods...

00:09:39.840 --> 00:09:41.519
Have you calculated the costs?

00:09:41.840 --> 00:09:42.759
You completely ignore the current

00:09:42.759 --> 00:09:44.600
cost structure of the wine market

00:09:44.759 --> 00:09:46.159
and the competitive landscape.

00:09:46.600 --> 00:09:47.519
If we do it your way,

00:09:48.279 --> 00:09:50.039
how much money must the company sink in?

00:09:50.799 --> 00:09:51.799
That's enough.

00:09:51.879 --> 00:09:52.639
Stop acting.

00:09:52.639 --> 00:09:53.720
There are no outsiders here.

00:09:54.120 --> 00:09:55.679
Aren't you just targeting me?

00:09:56.399 --> 00:09:57.720
You know very well

00:09:57.919 --> 00:10:00.240
that while this product needs upfront investment,

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:01.759
as long as it hits the market,

00:10:01.759 --> 00:10:03.159
it will definitely generate returns.

00:10:03.320 --> 00:10:04.919
The investment is worth it.

00:10:05.480 --> 00:10:06.639
Can you guarantee that?

00:10:07.399 --> 00:10:08.600
If it fails,

00:10:09.399 --> 00:10:10.519
can you take responsibility?

00:10:11.879 --> 00:10:13.000
I can guarantee it.

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:14.720
And I can take responsibility, too.

00:10:15.679 --> 00:10:18.399
Because I have great faith in my team,

00:10:19.639 --> 00:10:21.279
and this project is currently progressing

00:10:21.279 --> 00:10:22.799
very smoothly.

00:10:25.080 --> 00:10:26.200
But you, Ms. Lin...

00:10:26.759 --> 00:10:29.200
Have you been coasting here for so many years

00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:30.679
that you've gotten old

00:10:30.879 --> 00:10:32.600
and your thinking has become conservative?

00:10:33.960 --> 00:10:35.440
Stick to the matter at hand.

00:10:35.879 --> 00:10:37.840
Why resort to personal attacks?

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:39.759
Spare me the hypocrisy.

00:10:40.240 --> 00:10:41.720
Since we're speaking openly, that's fine.

00:10:42.039 --> 00:10:43.840
I'll lay it all out for you today.

00:10:44.120 --> 00:10:46.399
I'm determined to win this project.

00:10:47.879 --> 00:10:50.120
If your thinking can't keep up with the young,

00:10:50.519 --> 00:10:51.399
you have to accept it.

00:10:52.440 --> 00:10:54.519
The old gives way to the new.

00:10:55.360 --> 00:10:56.399
Pack up your things

00:10:56.399 --> 00:10:57.440
and step down.

00:11:05.720 --> 00:11:06.519
Sang Luo!

00:11:07.159 --> 00:11:08.039
Something happened!

00:11:16.080 --> 00:11:17.720
This batch of base wine is all like this.

00:11:17.720 --> 00:11:18.720
It's all moldy.

00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:19.919
That shouldn't be.

00:11:20.039 --> 00:11:21.360
Is it all like this?

00:11:21.960 --> 00:11:22.759
Yes.

00:11:23.559 --> 00:11:24.759
Did you investigate the cause?

00:11:24.840 --> 00:11:26.960
I've checked every single step.

00:11:27.000 --> 00:11:28.080
It's probably

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:29.639
the Xiajin mulberry leaf fermentation technique

00:11:29.639 --> 00:11:30.559
that caused the problem.

00:11:33.399 --> 00:11:36.279
The industry is eyeing Xiajin mulberry leaf fermentation.

00:11:36.320 --> 00:11:37.320
But unfortunately,

00:11:37.519 --> 00:11:39.200
you're probably too late.

00:11:46.039 --> 00:11:46.840
Sang Luo.

00:11:48.440 --> 00:11:50.519
Do you like the big gift I sent you?

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:02.440
I heard your Xiajin mulberry leaf fermentation failed.

00:12:02.679 --> 00:12:04.440
I told you long ago,

00:12:04.639 --> 00:12:06.039
the fermentation of Xiajin mulberry leaf

00:12:06.039 --> 00:12:08.120
doesn't just succeed because you have the technique.

00:12:10.159 --> 00:12:12.240
It's a pity that as soon as you heard the news,

00:12:12.240 --> 00:12:15.080
you couldn't wait to rush over and get the technique.

00:12:18.360 --> 00:12:19.639
I wonder...

00:12:19.879 --> 00:12:20.799
this time,

00:12:21.080 --> 00:12:22.279
is it enough to get you

00:12:22.320 --> 00:12:23.960
kicked out of Gufeng Group?

00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:49.039
Luo Xia

00:12:49.679 --> 00:12:50.480
Luo Xia

00:12:50.759 --> 00:12:51.559
Luo Xia

00:12:54.240 --> 00:12:55.440
What's going on?

00:12:55.639 --> 00:12:56.480
Where did she go?

00:12:56.480 --> 00:12:57.519
She's not answering her phone.

00:12:57.720 --> 00:12:58.519
Don't worry.

00:12:58.679 --> 00:12:59.960
She might have gone out for something.

00:13:01.240 --> 00:13:02.480
The thing about the fermentation technology,

00:13:03.120 --> 00:13:03.840
it was Lin Wanmei

00:13:03.840 --> 00:13:05.600
who told me through Luo Xia.

00:13:06.159 --> 00:13:08.279
She must know about my relationship with Luo Xia.

00:13:08.440 --> 00:13:09.519
Knowing Lin Wanmei's personality,

00:13:09.519 --> 00:13:10.840
she would never let her off.

00:13:16.279 --> 00:13:17.879
Hello? Luo Xia, where are you?

00:13:18.200 --> 00:13:19.840
I'm on vacation with my boyfriend.

00:13:19.879 --> 00:13:21.120
I didn't have time to tell you.

00:13:21.279 --> 00:13:22.159
I'll send you a picture.

00:13:22.240 --> 00:13:23.120
I'm going swimming now.

00:13:23.200 --> 00:13:23.840
You...

00:13:25.600 --> 00:13:26.399
What did she say?

00:13:28.919 --> 00:13:30.879
She said she went traveling with her boyfriend.

00:13:32.960 --> 00:13:34.080
What about the patent issue?

00:13:35.279 --> 00:13:36.279
Let's not tell her for now.

00:13:36.279 --> 00:13:37.240
As long as she's fine.

00:13:37.240 --> 00:13:38.159
Let her have fun.

00:13:38.720 --> 00:13:39.879
Otherwise, if she finds out,

00:13:39.879 --> 00:13:41.000
she'll definitely blame herself.

00:13:41.879 --> 00:13:42.679
Let's go.

00:13:51.360 --> 00:13:52.159
Baby,

00:13:52.519 --> 00:13:53.320
look,

00:13:53.480 --> 00:13:55.080
I'm the only one who's always been with you.

00:13:55.320 --> 00:13:56.720
I'm in a tough spot right now.

00:13:56.840 --> 00:13:57.919
Will you please help me?

00:13:57.960 --> 00:13:58.679
Help me.

00:13:58.919 --> 00:13:59.720
I'm begging you.

00:14:01.159 --> 00:14:02.159
Just take this spa,

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:03.559
how about you pawn it?

00:14:04.320 --> 00:14:05.039
What do you say?

00:14:05.759 --> 00:14:06.559
In your dreams!

00:14:06.840 --> 00:14:07.639
In your dreams!

00:14:07.720 --> 00:14:08.799
Will you agree or not?

00:14:08.879 --> 00:14:09.759
Will you agree?

00:14:09.919 --> 00:14:10.720
No!

00:14:13.399 --> 00:14:14.559
You won't agree, huh?

00:14:14.559 --> 00:14:15.320
Will you agree?

00:14:18.600 --> 00:14:20.440
I have all sorts of ways to make you agree.

00:14:26.720 --> 00:14:27.519
Tell me.

00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:28.639
Wanmei,

00:14:28.679 --> 00:14:29.519
I found out.

00:14:29.879 --> 00:14:30.919
Sang Luo and Ye Xiaowei

00:14:31.080 --> 00:14:32.960
were previously admitted to the same hospital in Korea.

00:14:33.279 --> 00:14:33.879
After that,

00:14:33.879 --> 00:14:35.279
you received the news of Ye Xiaowei's death.

00:14:35.559 --> 00:14:36.480
But Sang Luo

00:14:36.480 --> 00:14:37.879
had already come back two years ago.

00:14:37.879 --> 00:14:39.200
She just hasn't shown up.

00:14:39.759 --> 00:14:40.759
So I suspect

00:14:41.559 --> 00:14:42.440
something's fishy here.

00:14:43.399 --> 00:14:44.240
You're saying

00:14:45.639 --> 00:14:47.000
Ye Xiaowei is Sang Luo?

00:14:47.320 --> 00:14:48.799
It's not impossible.

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:49.840
After all,

00:14:49.840 --> 00:14:51.120
Korea's plastic surgery industry is advanced.

00:14:52.440 --> 00:14:53.840
Let me formally introduce myself.

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:55.440
My name is Sang Luo.

00:14:55.720 --> 00:14:56.559
Thank you, boss.

00:14:56.559 --> 00:14:58.039
I will definitely work hard.

00:14:59.799 --> 00:15:00.639
Wanmei.

00:15:02.480 --> 00:15:03.279
Sang Luo.

00:15:04.639 --> 00:15:05.559
Ye Xiaowei.

00:15:08.279 --> 00:15:09.279
I am someone who

00:15:09.320 --> 00:15:10.279
is hard to kill.

00:15:10.759 --> 00:15:12.360
Ordinary people can't kill me.

00:15:18.279 --> 00:15:20.039
Taking this opportunity today,

00:15:20.039 --> 00:15:21.360
I also want to announce to you all

00:15:21.360 --> 00:15:23.080
my other identity.

00:15:23.720 --> 00:15:24.879
I am Kista.

00:15:25.879 --> 00:15:26.679
Ye Xiaowei.

00:15:28.159 --> 00:15:29.759
Whether you are human or a ghost,

00:15:30.600 --> 00:15:31.960
Sang Luo or Kista,

00:15:33.000 --> 00:15:34.440
I won't lose to you.

00:15:35.480 --> 00:15:36.639
I won't.

00:15:41.279 --> 00:15:42.080
Everyone.

00:15:42.600 --> 00:15:44.080
I gathered you all here today

00:15:44.120 --> 00:15:46.120
to reveal a shocking truth.

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:47.799
Right here,

00:15:48.240 --> 00:15:50.360
someone has told a massive lie.

00:15:51.279 --> 00:15:53.080
The company has had a lot of issues lately.

00:15:53.360 --> 00:15:54.480
The stock price keeps falling,

00:15:54.480 --> 00:15:55.639
and we're in turmoil.

00:15:56.159 --> 00:15:57.639
Behind all of this,

00:15:57.840 --> 00:16:00.480
there's a mastermind pulling the strings.

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:02.039
I originally thought

00:16:02.039 --> 00:16:03.360
it was just the Cheng family's business,

00:16:03.720 --> 00:16:05.120
that the younger generation was immature

00:16:05.320 --> 00:16:06.200
and ignorant.

00:16:06.360 --> 00:16:07.159
Ms. Lin,

00:16:08.559 --> 00:16:09.639
watch your words.

00:16:10.799 --> 00:16:11.639
Mr. An,

00:16:12.000 --> 00:16:13.519
I'm not finished speaking yet.

00:16:13.519 --> 00:16:14.759
Don't be so anxious.

00:16:17.000 --> 00:16:17.960
This person

00:16:18.159 --> 00:16:19.200
has been pretending to be the daughter

00:16:19.200 --> 00:16:21.320
of my late husband, Cheng Feng,

00:16:21.440 --> 00:16:23.120
to stir up trouble in Gufeng Group.

00:16:24.039 --> 00:16:24.840
However,

00:16:27.320 --> 00:16:29.240
she is not Sang Luo at all.

00:16:29.360 --> 00:16:31.080
Her real identity is...

00:16:32.879 --> 00:16:33.440
Ye

00:16:33.559 --> 00:16:34.480
Xiao

00:16:34.480 --> 00:16:35.600
wei.

00:16:37.399 --> 00:16:38.679
Ye Xiaowei.

00:16:38.960 --> 00:16:40.320
The one from the Wine Competition three years ago

00:16:40.320 --> 00:16:41.279
who poisoned the wine?

00:16:41.320 --> 00:16:41.799
No way.

00:16:41.799 --> 00:16:42.440
Yeah.

00:16:43.240 --> 00:16:44.240
She doesn't look like her at all.

00:16:44.240 --> 00:16:45.000
Ye Xiaowei,

00:16:45.639 --> 00:16:47.080
do you have anything else to say?

00:16:49.600 --> 00:16:50.399
That's right.

00:16:54.200 --> 00:16:55.440
I am Ye Xiaowei.

00:16:58.080 --> 00:16:59.960
Ye Xiaowei, you fraud!

00:17:00.519 --> 00:17:01.279
Sneaking into the Cheng family

00:17:01.279 --> 00:17:02.320
and infiltrating the company,

00:17:02.600 --> 00:17:03.600
what other dark secrets

00:17:03.600 --> 00:17:04.920
are you hiding?

00:17:06.039 --> 00:17:06.960
Three years ago,

00:17:07.319 --> 00:17:08.720
I was wrongfully imprisoned.

00:17:09.680 --> 00:17:11.599
I barely escaped with my life.

00:17:12.000 --> 00:17:13.720
Posing as Sang Luo to enter the Cheng family

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:15.160
was my only option.

00:17:15.480 --> 00:17:17.039
You've always been ruthless.

00:17:17.319 --> 00:17:18.200
Three years ago,

00:17:18.200 --> 00:17:20.000
you poisoned the wine to win the competition.

00:17:20.480 --> 00:17:22.480
What else are you capable of?

00:17:22.680 --> 00:17:25.480
Since Ms. Lin mentioned the poisoning three years ago,

00:17:26.079 --> 00:17:27.960
we both know exactly

00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:29.839
who actually poisoned the wine.

00:17:30.079 --> 00:17:30.960
Do you dare say

00:17:31.519 --> 00:17:32.640
you've never done anything

00:17:32.640 --> 00:17:35.000
to harm Gufeng Group's interests?

00:17:36.680 --> 00:17:37.559
You used without authorization

00:17:37.559 --> 00:17:40.000
the immature Xiajin mulberry leaf brewing technique.

00:17:40.039 --> 00:17:41.559
Causing the base wine to spoil

00:17:41.680 --> 00:17:44.599
and the company to suffer huge financial losses.

00:17:45.359 --> 00:17:46.759
How are you going to explain that?

00:17:47.079 --> 00:17:48.960
This matter is indeed my responsibility.

00:17:51.839 --> 00:17:52.640
Everyone,

00:17:53.440 --> 00:17:54.799
I have reason to suspect

00:17:55.680 --> 00:17:56.680
that Ye Xiaowei

00:17:57.599 --> 00:18:00.160
is a corporate spy sent by someone else.

00:18:00.559 --> 00:18:01.359
Enough!

00:18:04.599 --> 00:18:05.400
Lin Wanmei,

00:18:06.039 --> 00:18:07.319
don't go too far.

00:18:10.160 --> 00:18:11.400
I arranged this.

00:18:12.720 --> 00:18:14.559
Whether it's the Cheng family or Gufeng Group,

00:18:15.039 --> 00:18:16.640
I think both have huge problems.

00:18:17.680 --> 00:18:18.559
I wanted to reform,

00:18:18.559 --> 00:18:19.680
but I lacked the power.

00:18:20.759 --> 00:18:22.200
I needed someone to help me,

00:18:22.240 --> 00:18:23.319
so I sought her out.

00:18:23.880 --> 00:18:25.319
Even now,

00:18:25.519 --> 00:18:27.039
you're still defending her?

00:18:27.039 --> 00:18:28.599
Everything I said is true.

00:18:28.599 --> 00:18:29.640
Is there a problem?

00:18:33.720 --> 00:18:34.640
It looks like

00:18:34.880 --> 00:18:37.200
this is your Cheng family's own business.

00:18:37.279 --> 00:18:38.000
Then why don't we just...

00:18:38.000 --> 00:18:39.079
Since it's a family matter,

00:18:39.839 --> 00:18:41.200
why don't we listen to

00:18:41.359 --> 00:18:42.680
what the old madam thinks.

00:18:53.200 --> 00:18:54.519
Ye Xiaowei.

00:18:54.839 --> 00:18:56.359
You have some nerve.

00:18:57.200 --> 00:18:59.799
Daring to impersonate a member of the Cheng family.

00:19:01.039 --> 00:19:01.839
And you.

00:19:02.519 --> 00:19:04.480
You knew she was an impostor,

00:19:04.480 --> 00:19:05.880
yet you protected her at every turn.

00:19:06.480 --> 00:19:08.960
How can you face your late brother?

00:19:09.359 --> 00:19:10.720
The one who wronged my brother...

00:19:11.559 --> 00:19:12.759
is someone else entirely.

00:19:13.599 --> 00:19:14.319
Mom.

00:19:14.680 --> 00:19:15.839
As for this matter,

00:19:17.359 --> 00:19:18.799
she can explain it in prison.

00:19:19.200 --> 00:19:20.000
Wait a minute.

00:19:20.640 --> 00:19:22.240
This whole thing started because of me.

00:19:23.079 --> 00:19:23.720
So,

00:19:23.720 --> 00:19:24.880
I must take primary responsibility.

00:19:25.480 --> 00:19:26.880
If you're willing to let her go,

00:19:27.440 --> 00:19:28.119
I will resign and take responsibility.

00:19:28.119 --> 00:19:30.039
This has nothing to do with Cheng An.

00:19:31.680 --> 00:19:33.920
And there is no corporate spy at all.

00:19:36.319 --> 00:19:38.359
I impersonated Sang Luo to enter the Cheng family

00:19:39.279 --> 00:19:40.240
only to find

00:19:40.240 --> 00:19:42.440
evidence of you framing me three years ago.

00:19:45.480 --> 00:19:46.279
Lin Wanmei.

00:19:47.880 --> 00:19:50.000
I'll leave Gufeng Group and the Cheng family.

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:51.799
Let's end this matter right here.

00:19:52.200 --> 00:19:53.359
End this here?

00:19:54.519 --> 00:19:55.960
You impersonated a Cheng family member

00:19:56.440 --> 00:19:58.759
and caused immense losses to the company.

00:19:59.839 --> 00:20:01.200
The board of directors

00:20:01.319 --> 00:20:02.920
will set up an investigative team

00:20:03.680 --> 00:20:05.519
to hold you fully accountable.

00:20:10.440 --> 00:20:11.799
Why did you treat Sang Luo like this?

00:20:15.440 --> 00:20:17.160
Why shouldn't I treat her like this?

00:20:18.160 --> 00:20:19.759
You two are both bastards.

00:20:20.480 --> 00:20:21.359
Why

00:20:21.799 --> 00:20:23.519
should I take your side?

00:20:24.400 --> 00:20:26.559
You're the person I hate most in this world.

00:20:27.119 --> 00:20:29.640
What right do you have to negotiate with me?

00:20:31.240 --> 00:20:32.759
As for the Cheng family...

00:20:33.279 --> 00:20:34.319
My son...

00:20:34.319 --> 00:20:35.359
My daughter...

00:20:35.519 --> 00:20:36.319
One is dead,

00:20:36.319 --> 00:20:37.279
the other is insane.

00:20:37.759 --> 00:20:40.200
Even my most beloved granddaughter

00:20:41.279 --> 00:20:43.079
turned out to be a fake.

00:20:45.480 --> 00:20:47.160
What do I have to fear?

00:20:51.039 --> 00:20:52.359
How will you deal with me?

00:20:54.680 --> 00:20:55.480
Kill me?

00:20:57.200 --> 00:20:58.000
Bring it on!

00:20:59.640 --> 00:21:00.440
Do it!

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:07.240
You wouldn't dare.

00:21:08.400 --> 00:21:10.160
You're just a Coward.

00:21:15.279 --> 00:21:16.559
What are you staring at?

00:21:24.559 --> 00:21:25.720
I pity you.

00:21:26.920 --> 00:21:28.880
You don't even know who your real enemy is.

00:21:30.559 --> 00:21:31.359
What do you mean?

00:21:34.240 --> 00:21:35.200
Do you remember

00:21:35.359 --> 00:21:36.720
when Sang Hui came to the Cheng family?

00:21:38.359 --> 00:21:39.359
She said then

00:21:41.200 --> 00:21:42.200
that Sang Luo was gravely ill,

00:21:42.200 --> 00:21:43.359
and came to ask my brother for money.

00:21:43.599 --> 00:21:45.039
But Lin Wanmei sent her away.

00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:47.000
And so?

00:21:48.200 --> 00:21:49.000
So,

00:21:49.880 --> 00:21:51.680
the person who killed your own granddaughter

00:21:52.440 --> 00:21:53.599
was Lin Wanmei.

00:22:02.440 --> 00:22:03.519
No!

00:22:19.960 --> 00:22:21.519
You still have the nerve to come here.

00:22:21.880 --> 00:22:22.640
If I had a choice,

00:22:22.640 --> 00:22:24.720
I wouldn't set foot anywhere near the Cheng family.

00:22:26.000 --> 00:22:27.559
But today, I have something

00:22:27.559 --> 00:22:29.279
that I must hand to you personally.

00:22:31.119 --> 00:22:33.559
Aunt Sang entrusted me to pass this to you.

00:22:34.119 --> 00:22:35.880
Inside is what Sang Luo

00:22:35.880 --> 00:22:37.079
wanted to say to you before she left.

00:22:37.799 --> 00:22:38.599
Take a look.

00:22:50.119 --> 00:22:52.200
To the Cheng family I deeply resent,

00:22:53.279 --> 00:22:54.880
By the time you read this letter,

00:22:56.200 --> 00:22:57.920
I will have already left this world,

00:22:59.000 --> 00:23:00.640
ending a life filled with pain

00:23:00.640 --> 00:23:02.160
and torment.

00:23:03.839 --> 00:23:06.240
I once dreamed of the warmth of family,

00:23:07.559 --> 00:23:10.400
but when I gathered the courage to ask you for help,

00:23:11.160 --> 00:23:12.400
what awaited me

00:23:12.960 --> 00:23:15.480
was Lin Wanmei's ridicule and mockery.

00:23:22.000 --> 00:23:22.799
Two thousand.

00:23:22.960 --> 00:23:23.759
Ms. Lin.

00:23:23.880 --> 00:23:24.720
Ms. Sang.

00:23:25.359 --> 00:23:26.799
Hurry and take your child to see a doctor.

00:23:26.799 --> 00:23:27.519
Grandma.

00:23:27.519 --> 00:23:29.240
In your eyes,

00:23:29.559 --> 00:23:31.759
I was just a dispensable burden, wasn't I?

00:23:32.440 --> 00:23:34.079
Illness tormented my body,

00:23:34.960 --> 00:23:37.799
but you shattered my very soul.

00:23:38.759 --> 00:23:39.880
In my next life,

00:23:40.680 --> 00:23:42.640
I hope to never have anything to do

00:23:43.119 --> 00:23:44.359
with the Cheng family again.

00:23:44.359 --> 00:23:45.720
I'm sorry.

00:23:47.480 --> 00:23:50.160
I'm sorry I failed you.

00:24:22.200 --> 00:24:22.920
Waiting for me?

00:24:22.920 --> 00:24:23.640
Dongdong.

00:24:26.279 --> 00:24:27.720
Are you never coming back?

00:24:29.160 --> 00:24:29.960
Sister Xiaowei.

00:24:33.839 --> 00:24:35.640
I know you already knew.

00:24:40.680 --> 00:24:41.599
When necessary,

00:24:42.400 --> 00:24:43.680
you do have the courage,

00:24:44.759 --> 00:24:46.079
whether to protect yourself

00:24:47.279 --> 00:24:48.559
or to protect your friends.

00:24:52.319 --> 00:24:53.119
Dongdong,

00:24:55.559 --> 00:24:57.599
the last person in this house I wanted to lie to

00:24:57.599 --> 00:24:58.480
was you.

00:25:01.200 --> 00:25:02.000
I'm sorry.

00:25:02.839 --> 00:25:04.799
I still hid my identity from you.

00:25:05.319 --> 00:25:06.119
It's okay,

00:25:06.680 --> 00:25:07.480
Sister Xiaowei.

00:25:08.720 --> 00:25:09.519
I know

00:25:10.400 --> 00:25:11.839
you have your own goals.

00:25:14.119 --> 00:25:14.920
And I

00:25:20.799 --> 00:25:22.599
also have the courage to protect my friends.

00:25:32.799 --> 00:25:34.240
You've really grown up.

00:25:46.839 --> 00:25:47.759
It's just a pity

00:25:48.519 --> 00:25:49.839
that the roses in this greenhouse

00:25:50.519 --> 00:25:52.359
must live in this swamp forever.

00:25:59.880 --> 00:26:01.799
But our roses

00:26:02.119 --> 00:26:04.000
will bloom in a better place.

00:27:08.880 --> 00:27:09.680
It's been three years.

00:27:10.599 --> 00:27:11.839
You're finally back.

00:27:29.720 --> 00:27:30.519
Cheng An.

00:27:31.279 --> 00:27:32.519
Then the person you're waiting for,

00:27:33.839 --> 00:27:34.920
is it Sang Luo,

00:27:34.920 --> 00:27:36.240
or Ye Xiaowei?

00:27:43.079 --> 00:27:44.279
Whether it's Xiaowei,

00:27:44.440 --> 00:27:45.759
or Sang Luo,

00:27:46.720 --> 00:27:48.480
they're both just another you in my heart.

00:27:54.240 --> 00:27:56.480
I've been afraid to ask you all these days.

00:27:59.519 --> 00:28:02.200
I was afraid I wasn't the one you were looking for.

00:28:11.079 --> 00:28:12.400
No matter how you change,

00:28:14.920 --> 00:28:16.559
you are the only one in my heart.

00:28:37.559 --> 00:28:38.359
Come in.

00:28:41.720 --> 00:28:42.519
Mr. Yi.

00:28:42.680 --> 00:28:44.160
Someone ran up a bill at our club

00:28:44.160 --> 00:28:45.119
and owes us a lot of money.

00:28:45.279 --> 00:28:46.359
They left this as collateral.

00:28:47.000 --> 00:28:47.799
Collateral.